"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/afb2d431dd228232b661bf25c32895c7ed567133/ss_afb2d431dd228232b661bf25c32895c7ed567133.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774473129","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810600/afb2d431dd228232b661bf25c32895c7ed567133/ss_afb2d431dd228232b661bf25c32895c7ed567133.600x338.jpg?t=1774473129"}],"short_description":"Awaken Reng Azure in a post-apocalyptic world. Master teleportation in 4 directions, travel through portals connected to the realm of souls, evolve your soul, explore corrupted regions and choose between combat or redemption in this 2D pixel art action and exploration journey.","steam_appid":3810600,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61575893384905"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, German, Korean, Japanese, Russian","type":"game","website":null}